<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-21T07:52:24.310Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:52:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Former FDLR fighters are crossing back into Rwanda while Kenyan and other long-distance truck drivers suspend DRC-bound cargo after 12 drivers were killed, prompting Kenya to halt operations and Uganda to close the border over Ebola fears. Rebel groups, including the FRN near Lubumbashi and ADF in Ituri, continue attacks that have killed civilians and threatened regional security, while the African Union is urging cease-fire compliance and inclusive dialogue. The Ebola outbreak has expanded to an eighth province, prompting heightened alerts in Lubumbashi and calls for border closures. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOVmtGNnh1eEVPdVVMcjNWaDlhdGppSTVHT0ZmNEVCOTJocHVvVGUzakc2YUJFLTFWU2ZXNElyUTJXcGltdEVkNWpsakxRb052dGxMUnRVZXV2NWFiQlBOQjdILTZhZXY0el9sYU1Yci1rQXVjclUyWEc2UHJadC1TSU40RmF1b0FHR2dmbmllN3pkWmwyek85azVSVDc0cDBvenVaSw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kenyans.co.ke&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQbnJVMTIxXzdldWE4SGRLUGk3MDJMYWZ4eEU3QTczeDdzdWRmNFBLTDByWHpRbmwzMzhlS3V2T2I2NXd0NGZxM20yMmpYeWdVbms2V1pJTjdVaG9vQ194WE5HQ0xvWDlxSU1xUkdaYkI2Tkx5MTlZRC1hTXdFeUxFdkxCekxSYUJNbHlIdnh6TzNsdFYtLVAyN0dQNzRpQXc0TW0wNzVQRkJ4WlZpNFhtTHpLd0pLbUhweFVOZ3pnQWZtZmNY?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPcWZESFczOGsycWtha3cwU3ltZml5TXBEUVVvakFHV0o0cXZNaWJtZS00ajhUeG1ZMUkydlpuWEU3enBCUy1UazQ3eDZxYnFOZk1haUk1MjJnTDMxaGdMTFk5VXEycjdOR2NFQy1BVFF4Qjh5ZE5PQkV1OWItMjJxSk82bG1vRHdxME9SeUxEcENoX3hXdjdLRi16a1J1emhCQkh3dmVTYWVidUtETlQtZWs0ajVYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;People Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV